# Example secrets for the Google Chat triage assistant.
#
# The REAL file lives OUTSIDE this repo at
#   ~/.claude-orchestrator/gchat-triage/secrets.env
# and is created automatically (chmod 600) on first config load. This example
# holds NO real values and exists only to document the expected keys in-tree.
#
# Uncomment and fill in to enable Telegram notifications (Phase 4):
# TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=
# TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID=
